From 07930ea0212d47ffffe709954f29cd0075950c94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/19] test-posix: Check <locale.h>, setlocale, newlocale,
 uselocale and localeconv

Check the header's macros, types and prototypes; the POSIX locale at
startup and its localeconv values; setlocale's restoring strings, its
failures and the LC_ALL, LC_* and LANG precedence for ""; newlocale's
errors, masks and base, duplocale, freelocale and getlocalename_l; and
uselocale's queries, thread-local locales and the functions that
follow them. Checks of C.UTF-8 run when picolibc is built with
multibyte support.
